    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the mechanics said they checked the cooling unit and everything looks physically fine, like there's no obvious damage or broken parts, but the system just keeps cutting out for no reason. it's super frustrating. can you help me troubleshoot why a unit would just randomly stop working like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
