    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah we checked the sensors and the wiring seems okay... it just feels like something is messing with it. like the power cuts exactly when it's supposed to kick in, then it's fine for an hour, then it happens again. it's so weirdly timed. is there anything else that causes these kinds of unexplainable, sudden glitches in these types of machines?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
